%%body
{
  Moving from one chamber to another was simple enough, you had done it before... you think.

  With near silence, the pathway behind you vanished, it felt... unsettling to say the least, and not familiar at all.

  But you did remember the next sequence.

    @ Voice "Good to see you greenhorns know how to put one foot in front of the other at least, let's spice things up, you straw legs at least know how to jump yeah, climb up and jump across."

  You wander up the stairs and look at the comically small gap, jumping over to the other side of the space, you sigh and move on.

  The next chamber is through the doorway and on the other side, yet the chamber behind you vanishes once more as if it had never existed.

  Unsettling to say the least, but at least you made it to the next chamber.
}
%date 2026-08-12
